# Line endings: text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with LF on every PC,
# independent of core.autocrlf. Without these rules Git only warns "LF will be replaced by CRLF" for
# files that are not listed here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
